  "title": "Hardware and Software Validation for Scaleable sUAS Production",
  "summary": "Silent supplier changes, hidden defects, and undocumented software drift are some of the biggest causes of field failures and RMAs in scaled drone programs. The Anvil Checkpoint gives drone manufacturers an objective way to verify whether received COTS electronics are truly equivalent to what was previously qualified.",
